# Pothole Mole (2/3): "When this creature enters, mill three cards, then you may return a land card from your graveyard to your
# hand." The mill puts Forest, Mountain and Memnite there; the choice is made after it, so a card just milled may be taken. Memnite
# is not a land card (the refusal), Mountain is taken: it is in hand, and the Forest and Memnite stay in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Pothole Mole
Island x3
Forest
Mountain
Memnite
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pothole Mole.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)

[Expect]
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Graveyard = Memnite; Forest
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Mountain
Bot1.Library.Count = 20
